(Cache folder: %TEMP%\\LiveGardenTVPlus\\epg_cache): (Folda ya akiba: %TEMP%\\LiveGardenTVPlus\\epg_cache)
(Completely voluntary – no features are blocked): (Kwa hiari kabisa - hakuna vipengele vilivyozuiwa)
(No description): (Hakuna maelezo)
• Add / rename / delete groups.: • Ongeza / badilisha jina / futa vikundi.
• Buffer slider: adjust HLS buffer (1‑10 seconds).: • Kitelezi cha bafa: rekebisha bafa ya HLS (sekunde 1-10).
• Check URL availability (only visible channels).: • Angalia upatikanaji wa URL (njia zinazoonekana pekee).
• Edit channel names, groups, URLs, logos, tvg-id, country, languages, favorites.: • Hariri majina ya vituo, vikundi, URL, nembo, tvg-id, nchi, lugha, vipendwa.
• Edit multiple URLs per channel (popup window).: • Hariri URL nyingi kwa kila kituo (dirisha ibukizi).
• Enrich with EPG: adds missing tvg-id using fuzzy matching.: • Boresha ukitumia EPG: huongeza tvg-id inayokosekana kwa kutumia ulinganishaji wa fuzzy.
• EPG info displayed in status bar for current channel.: • Maelezo ya EPG yanaonyeshwa kwenye upau wa hali ya kituo cha sasa.
• Export OK / FAIL / filtered lists as M3U or JSON.: • Hamisha OK / FAIL / orodha zilizochujwa kama M3U au JSON.
• Fetch logos from remote repository (OwnerPlugins/logos).: • Leta nembo kutoka kwa hazina ya mbali (OwnerPlugins/nembo).
• Fullscreen UI: hides sidebar and status bar (ESC to exit).: • UI ya skrini nzima: huficha utepe na upau wa hali (ESC ili kuondoka).
• Hide/Show channel list button.: • Ficha/Onyesha kitufe cha orodha ya kituo.
• Import JSON (local or URL) with flexible field mapping (auto-detect, save mapping).: • Leta JSON (ya ndani au URL) kwa kutumia ramani ya sehemu inayonyumbulika (gundua kiotomatiki, hifadhi ramani).
• Picture‑in‑Picture (PIP) button.: • Kitufe cha Picha-ndani-Picha (PIP).
• Playback speed: 0.5x, 1x, 2x buttons.: • Kasi ya kucheza: vitufe 0.5x, 1x, 2x.
• Sort any column by clicking header; use 'Reset Order' to revert to original order.: • Panga safu wima yoyote kwa kubofya kichwa; tumia 'Weka Upya Agizo' ili kurejesha agizo asili.
• Timeshift: pause live stream; drag slider to seek back; press 'Live' to return.: • Timeshift: sitisha mtiririko wa moja kwa moja; buruta kitelezi kutafuta nyuma; bonyeza 'Live' ili kurudi.
◀ Previous: ◀ Iliyotangulia
16 colour themes + Light/Dark variants.: Mandhari 16 ya rangi + Nyepesi/Vibadala vya Giza.
